    <description>Catalog of ranks within a style. One record per rank, where a rank is a belt plus its degree (e.g. Black 1st, Black 2nd), so Sort_Order__c stays a single sort key and the next rank is always Sort_Order__c + 1.
Color__c and Degree__c are for display and grouping only. Reference data — not transactional.</description>
